| Tool | Function Used | Project Filtering | Scope |
|------|---------------|-------------------|-------|
| **session_search** | `getAllSessions()` | ❌ **NO** | **ALL projects/instances** |
| **session_list** | `getMainSessions({ directory })` | ✅ **YES** (defaults to `process.cwd()`) | **Current project only** (unless `project_path` specified) |

